WEBVTT

00:24.896 --> 00:28.000
♪I woke up in a strange place♪

00:31.123 --> 00:34.080
♪The sunlight here is blindingly bright♪

00:37.216 --> 00:40.736
♪Pages rustle, and I hear a loud voice♪

00:42.656 --> 00:47.712
♪I've become the center of the story♪

00:48.608 --> 00:52.978
♪I must escape this dream♪

00:54.560 --> 00:59.160
♪Yet why does my heart
surrender before you♪

01:00.128 --> 01:04.032
♪Clearly, it's a fake plot♪

01:04.352 --> 01:06.528
♪A fake world♪

01:07.232 --> 01:12.224
♪Yet eventually,
my heart is open to you♪

01:37.088 --> 01:40.896
=My Page in the 90s=
(Adapted from "Bye, Wild Weasel")

01:41.000 --> 01:43.848
=Episode 12=

01:44.936 --> 01:45.815
Gao Haiming.

01:47.496 --> 01:49.216
Die'en? Long time no see.

01:49.375 --> 01:50.455
Long time no see.

01:50.455 --> 01:51.136
Long time no see.

01:55.776 --> 01:57.216
Let me introduce you, Xiaojue.

01:59.095 --> 01:59.936
Hurry up.

02:01.696 --> 02:02.776
Let me introduce you.

02:02.776 --> 02:04.535
Gao Haiming,
the General Manager of Letao,

02:04.535 --> 02:05.735
also a longtime family friend.

02:05.735 --> 02:08.775
Haiming, Ou Xiaojue
is my classmate from school.

02:08.775 --> 02:09.495
He's also my...

02:09.495 --> 02:11.215
Hello, Mr. Gao.
I've heard a lot about you.

02:13.775 --> 02:16.615
(Could this be my freeloading boyfriend
I've never met?)

02:18.576 --> 02:20.655
So that makes us alumni too.

02:21.696 --> 02:23.136
Nice to meet you, Mr. Ou.

02:26.416 --> 02:27.696
He's really impressive.

02:27.696 --> 02:30.576
I was planning to formally introduce him
to you at a proper time.

02:30.576 --> 02:32.016
Didn't expect we'd meet like this.

02:32.696 --> 02:33.335
Really?

02:35.536 --> 02:37.775
By the way, this is Miss Lin,

02:38.055 --> 02:38.816
my assistant.

02:39.856 --> 02:40.856
What a coincidence.

02:41.495 --> 02:46.576
I remember you had a close
male classmate studying in the UK.

02:47.136 --> 02:48.775
He also had the surname Ou, right?

02:52.136 --> 02:55.016
And he dumped a girlfriend
he'd been with for a long time.

02:56.576 --> 02:58.136
Of course, I'm not talking about you.

02:58.136 --> 02:58.935
Don't misunderstand.

03:00.935 --> 03:02.016
What a coincidence.

03:03.096 --> 03:05.608
There should be a bigger coincidence,
shouldn't there, Xiaojue?

03:09.536 --> 03:11.175
You two know each other?

03:13.735 --> 03:14.296
Yes.

03:15.256 --> 03:20.175
Miss Lin and I
are high school classmates.

03:22.816 --> 03:25.096
Yes, we're old classmates.

03:25.935 --> 03:26.976
Why so nervous?

03:26.976 --> 03:28.576
Aren't you happy
to see an old classmate?

03:29.696 --> 03:30.376
Yes!

03:31.055 --> 03:32.055
Of course, I'm happy.

03:32.935 --> 03:34.296
I've long heard of Mr. Gao.

03:34.296 --> 03:35.215
Never expected

03:36.096 --> 03:39.016
that my old classmate
became Mr. Gao's special assistant.

03:39.455 --> 03:40.376
Truly enviable.

03:41.296 --> 03:42.495
I'm the one who envies you.

03:42.775 --> 03:46.136
To be classmates now with such
an outstanding person as Miss Cheng,

03:46.696 --> 03:48.055
I really admire you.

03:51.576 --> 03:53.935
Wait, I'm a bit confused.

03:54.096 --> 03:56.455
Are all your classmate relationships
this complicated?

03:57.256 --> 04:00.376
Die'en, your father mentioned
you might have a boyfriend.

04:06.655 --> 04:10.016
What? Getting gossipy
right after meeting?

04:10.016 --> 04:12.495
No, I just wanted to meet him.

04:12.935 --> 04:13.976
Shall I give you a lift?

04:14.816 --> 04:16.576
No need. Someone's picking us up.

04:17.655 --> 04:18.816
Then we'll head off first.

04:19.256 --> 04:20.095
Alright, see you.

04:20.095 --> 04:20.736
Bye.

04:37.576 --> 04:38.496
The car's over there.

05:13.616 --> 05:15.256
What's wrong? Upset?

05:18.095 --> 05:20.816
Why did you tell Gao Haiming
I'm your classmate?

05:26.215 --> 05:27.496
So that's what bothers you.

05:28.215 --> 05:31.936
I wanted to wait for the right moment
to formally introduce our relationship.

05:34.655 --> 05:38.295
But why haven't I heard you mention
having another classmate also in the UK?

05:40.895 --> 05:42.295
Don't you know me?

05:42.936 --> 05:44.616
I was always focused on studying,

05:44.775 --> 05:46.215
oblivious to the outside world.

05:47.616 --> 05:49.295
But I heard that classmate abandoned...

05:49.295 --> 05:51.696
Things half a world away
are often just rumors.

06:00.576 --> 06:03.496
That Miss Lin made quite
a good first impression on me today.

06:07.576 --> 06:10.696
Shouldn't I get
to know your world better

06:10.696 --> 06:12.816
and know more
about your friends and family?

06:16.576 --> 06:17.655
We just got back.

06:17.655 --> 06:19.215
There's still so much to handle.

06:19.696 --> 06:20.855
Can it wait a while?

06:23.455 --> 06:24.095
Die'en,

06:25.176 --> 06:26.775
your parents haven't accepted me yet.

06:27.016 --> 06:28.936
And the place I'm living
is provided by you.

06:29.496 --> 06:31.975
I want to work hard
and achieve something significant.

06:32.855 --> 06:33.975
Only then will I be worthy.

06:35.455 --> 06:37.256
I believe you are the best.

06:37.256 --> 06:38.616
Just settle in here properly.

06:38.895 --> 06:41.616
I'll help you
figure out your job situation.

06:42.496 --> 06:44.016
Die'en, how are you so good?

06:45.975 --> 06:46.655
Hug.

06:47.256 --> 06:47.895
Okay.

06:53.576 --> 06:55.848
(Building 8)

07:00.936 --> 07:01.655
Haiming.

07:03.415 --> 07:03.895
Mom.

07:11.616 --> 07:13.576
You're back.

07:16.775 --> 07:18.256
I'm sorry for making you worry.

07:22.415 --> 07:23.176
You're back.

07:24.335 --> 07:25.496
It's good that you're back.

07:36.056 --> 07:37.215
It's good that you're back.

07:38.816 --> 07:39.576
It's okay now.

07:46.655 --> 07:47.496
I'm fine, Mom.

07:49.535 --> 07:50.095
Mom.

07:50.895 --> 07:51.616
It's okay, Mom.

07:52.215 --> 07:52.855
It's okay.

08:07.376 --> 08:08.415
Drink less coffee.

08:08.736 --> 08:09.736
You'll lose sleep.

08:09.736 --> 08:10.855
It hurts your health.

08:11.376 --> 08:13.215
You need sleep. I don't.

08:13.975 --> 08:16.256
Shouldn't I work several jobs
to support your studies

08:16.256 --> 08:17.215
and give you money?

08:17.215 --> 08:18.415
I have to support you.

08:19.616 --> 08:21.295
This guy needs a woman to support him.

08:23.095 --> 08:23.816
Huan'er, I...

08:23.816 --> 08:25.335
I know what you want to say.

08:26.535 --> 08:27.616
You want to say,

08:28.455 --> 08:30.975
"Take care of yourself
when you're alone."

08:30.975 --> 08:32.895
"Otherwise, I'll worry." Right?

08:34.895 --> 08:35.935
You know me after all.

08:37.415 --> 08:38.175
You don't know

08:38.616 --> 08:40.815
how much I missed you
when I was alone abroad.

08:41.295 --> 08:42.616
I was always concerned about you.

08:44.256 --> 08:46.016
Then why did you go abroad alone

08:46.216 --> 08:47.815
and came back with another woman?

08:49.496 --> 08:50.575
I was about to explain.

08:50.736 --> 08:51.720
Huan'er, you know what?

08:52.295 --> 08:53.336
I'm really in pain.

08:53.895 --> 08:55.655
I know I should have
only you in my heart.

08:55.655 --> 08:56.415
No one else.

08:56.775 --> 08:57.575
I don't deny

08:58.175 --> 08:59.616
the fact that Die'en did move me.

09:00.136 --> 09:01.736
At every sleepless night abroad,

09:01.736 --> 09:03.096
I couldn't forgive myself.

09:03.376 --> 09:05.376
There was always a voice reminding me.

09:05.935 --> 09:07.175
There's only you in my heart.

09:09.336 --> 09:10.456
Sorry, it's just that...

09:11.935 --> 09:13.136
May I ask you something?

09:13.935 --> 09:17.456
How can you describe cheating
and freeloading so affectionately?

09:19.496 --> 09:20.895
Huan'er, how can you say that?

09:21.256 --> 09:22.496
Warning! Warning!

09:22.655 --> 09:23.496
No spoilers!

09:23.575 --> 09:24.856
Do not alter relationships.

09:25.376 --> 09:26.856
During all my years in the UK,

09:27.935 --> 09:29.376
the money you sent me was little,

09:29.376 --> 09:30.695
and you weren't by my side.

09:31.496 --> 09:32.496
No blame, right?

09:33.016 --> 09:34.016
Warning! Warning!

09:34.695 --> 09:35.695
After all this time,

09:36.295 --> 09:37.856
have you ever understood my pressure?

09:41.535 --> 09:43.055
I didn't want to hurt you,

09:43.055 --> 09:44.695
so I held back a lot.

09:49.856 --> 09:50.575
Huan,

09:51.336 --> 09:52.295
you have to forgive me.

09:56.256 --> 09:59.456
You selfish, insecure, cowardly fool!

09:59.456 --> 10:01.016
You simply have a personality disorder!

10:01.016 --> 10:02.136
You live in your own world,

10:02.136 --> 10:03.136
self-centered.

10:03.136 --> 10:05.136
You think you're talented
and are smug about it.

10:05.136 --> 10:07.695
You want to fulfill your needs
by controlling others' emotions.

10:07.695 --> 10:09.136
I'm telling you. This is a sickness!

10:09.216 --> 10:10.535
A serious one. Need treatment!

10:10.695 --> 10:12.856
Forget it. Curing someone like you
is a waste of drug.

10:12.856 --> 10:13.895
You just can't be cured.

10:13.895 --> 10:14.935
You're hopeless.

10:14.935 --> 10:17.336
You don't deserve to live in this world.

10:18.815 --> 10:20.256
Do not alter the character's path.

10:20.256 --> 10:21.895
Triggered the punishment mechanism.

10:21.895 --> 10:23.055
Time Rewind.

10:23.496 --> 10:24.535
Two chances left.

10:24.775 --> 10:25.935
The system auto-locks.

10:26.175 --> 10:27.695
You will never return to your world.

10:29.376 --> 10:31.295
Huan, you have to forgive me.

10:37.336 --> 10:39.175
Fine, tell me.

10:39.695 --> 10:40.655
How can I forgive you?

10:45.655 --> 10:46.336
Huan,

10:47.415 --> 10:49.456
I know you hold resentment

10:49.456 --> 10:50.456
about Die'en.

10:51.136 --> 10:53.096
I also understand you're feeling upset.

10:54.016 --> 10:55.175
But I only love you.

10:55.895 --> 10:56.895
Let me be honest.

10:57.016 --> 10:58.616
I am just using Die'en.

10:59.935 --> 11:01.376
When I become successful,

11:02.256 --> 11:03.575
I definitely won't let you down.

11:09.216 --> 11:11.695
You actually want me to accommodate you.

11:13.695 --> 11:14.496
Huan.

11:19.935 --> 11:20.535
Huan.

11:20.935 --> 11:21.815
Let's first

11:25.295 --> 11:25.976
break up.

11:26.895 --> 11:28.535
But I promise. It's only temporary.

11:29.136 --> 11:30.496
It's a deal.

11:31.815 --> 11:32.736
No backing out.

11:32.736 --> 11:33.935
You said it yourself.

11:34.216 --> 11:36.096
From now on, we're broken up.

11:36.976 --> 11:37.695
Don't look for me.

11:38.775 --> 11:39.336
I'm leaving.

11:42.376 --> 11:42.935
By the way,

11:44.136 --> 11:45.136
since we've broken up,

11:45.136 --> 11:47.496
the living expenses and tuition
I sent you over the years,

11:47.496 --> 11:49.415
remember to pay me back with interest.

11:50.895 --> 11:51.856
Wait, Huan'er.

11:53.016 --> 11:53.575
Huan'er.

11:54.616 --> 11:56.535
You can do whatever you want to me.

11:56.775 --> 11:59.895
But money isn't necessary, right?

12:02.575 --> 12:03.376
Well...

12:12.895 --> 12:13.575
That's better.

12:14.856 --> 12:16.456
You said I can do whatever to you.

12:17.136 --> 12:18.216
Remember to repay.

12:30.792 --> 12:31.736
(Letao Tower)

12:31.736 --> 12:34.016
This is my upcoming
personal design exhibition.

12:34.016 --> 12:36.535
If you have time, you can come and see.

12:37.456 --> 12:39.695
Were these all taken
when you were studying abroad?

12:40.175 --> 12:41.136
Impressive.

12:42.415 --> 12:43.096
How is it?

12:43.175 --> 12:45.016
Doesn't it fit perfectly
with the Her Series?

12:45.216 --> 12:46.895
I was wondering why you came to see me.

12:47.136 --> 12:48.456
So you're here to give me a gift.

12:49.336 --> 12:50.775
Don't get the wrong idea.

12:51.136 --> 12:53.415
I just really like the slogan
for the Her Series.

12:53.895 --> 12:55.655
Seeing women's needs.

12:56.016 --> 12:58.575
I didn't expect you
to be so progressive, Haoming.

12:59.856 --> 13:00.736
You overestimate me.

13:01.456 --> 13:03.256
That slogan was proposed by Lin Huan'er.

13:03.815 --> 13:06.256
She's also responsible
for the overall control of the product.

13:06.655 --> 13:08.256
So it was you who did it.

13:09.376 --> 13:10.736
I shouldn't have praised you.

13:11.295 --> 13:12.415
After returning this time,

13:12.616 --> 13:14.775
I became very interested
after seeing the Her Series.

13:15.256 --> 13:17.415
So I designed some packaging,

13:17.616 --> 13:19.415
based on your brand's tone.

13:20.535 --> 13:21.655
So cute!

13:22.016 --> 13:23.736
I also want to add women's health tips

13:23.736 --> 13:26.496
in comic form on the packaging.

13:26.815 --> 13:29.695
Release them randomly
to increase customer loyalty.

13:30.016 --> 13:33.736
Also, for packaging slogans on diapers
and other maternal products,

13:33.736 --> 13:35.216
instead of Love from Mom,

13:35.216 --> 13:36.856
change it to Making it Easier for Dad.

13:37.976 --> 13:38.856
Good idea.

13:40.496 --> 13:43.695
So, can we move forward
with this collaboration with Miss Cheng?

13:44.575 --> 13:45.376
Got it.

13:46.016 --> 13:47.295
I'll go start the process now.

13:47.815 --> 13:48.976
Miss Cheng, excuse me.

13:49.136 --> 13:51.136
I hope to have coffee
with you another time.

13:51.496 --> 13:53.295
Good. I was thinking the same thing.

14:00.815 --> 14:01.895
Just speak plainly.

14:03.856 --> 14:05.775
If you have time,

14:06.096 --> 14:08.136
I'd like to recommend someone to you.

14:13.456 --> 14:16.496
It's that Ou Xiaojue we met
at the airport last time?

14:16.736 --> 14:20.256
Yes. I didn't expect
I couldn't hide anything from you.

14:22.175 --> 14:22.976
Do you know him?

14:23.695 --> 14:24.935
I know him very well.

14:25.496 --> 14:26.695
He's my classmate.

14:26.695 --> 14:27.736
Excellent in everything.

14:28.016 --> 14:31.216
He just comes
from a less privileged background.

14:31.775 --> 14:33.256
But he's got ambition.

14:33.856 --> 14:35.575
Our last meeting was too rushed.

14:36.016 --> 14:37.136
Give him a chance.

14:37.575 --> 14:39.016
He definitely won't disappoint you.

14:40.815 --> 14:42.096
His family isn't well-off.

14:42.775 --> 14:44.256
Studying in Britain isn't cheap.

14:44.695 --> 14:45.976
So he's very hardworking.

14:48.744 --> 14:50.056
How long have you been together?

14:50.496 --> 14:51.376
Us?

14:52.695 --> 14:53.736
Almost three years.

14:55.295 --> 14:56.096
Why?

14:57.535 --> 14:58.136
Nothing.

14:58.895 --> 15:01.695
Alright. Have him come for an interview
tomorrow morning.

15:02.175 --> 15:04.535
Great! It's settled then.

15:04.856 --> 15:05.655
I'll head out first.

15:06.175 --> 15:06.775
See you.

15:06.976 --> 15:07.616
Bye.

15:23.096 --> 15:24.856
Miss Cheng, leaving already?

15:25.016 --> 15:25.575
Yes.

15:26.175 --> 15:27.575
Our meeting yesterday was rushed.

15:27.895 --> 15:29.216
Didn't even have a proper chat.

15:30.935 --> 15:33.295
Ou Xiaojue has changed
quite a bit over the years.

15:33.295 --> 15:35.016
I almost didn't recognize him yesterday.

15:37.016 --> 15:39.935
Miss Lin, are you familiar with Xiaojue?

15:40.295 --> 15:41.376
No, not at all.

15:41.376 --> 15:42.456
Please don't misunderstand.

15:42.895 --> 15:45.535
I'm really not familiar with him at all.

15:45.535 --> 15:46.376
Nothing between us.

15:48.096 --> 15:49.575
Miss Lin, I know.

15:49.856 --> 15:52.016
Because Xiaojue told me
he's never dated anyone.

15:53.096 --> 15:53.895
Really?

15:55.096 --> 15:57.336
He said he's never dated anyone?

16:01.616 --> 16:03.496
No, he really hasn't.

16:06.496 --> 16:07.175
You go ahead.

16:07.175 --> 16:08.016
I forgot my things.

16:40.895 --> 16:41.695
Hello, Mr. Gao.

16:57.336 --> 17:00.055
Thank you, Mr. Gao, for giving me
this interview opportunity.

17:15.176 --> 17:17.295
Graduated from the University
of St Andrews, right?

17:19.095 --> 17:21.135
Yes, Applied Finance.

17:21.815 --> 17:22.736
During my studies, I...

17:22.736 --> 17:25.615
Mr. Ou, your family background
isn't affluent.

17:28.496 --> 17:29.775
How did you afford the tuition?

17:30.456 --> 17:31.375
I had scholarships.

17:33.095 --> 17:37.375
It says here you only received
two scholarships, each for 100 pounds.

17:39.615 --> 17:41.615
So I often did work-study.

17:43.416 --> 17:45.295
What kind of work?
What was the hourly wage?

17:46.775 --> 17:47.855
Cashier at a restaurant.

17:48.696 --> 17:49.575
Hourly wage...

17:53.815 --> 17:54.696
20 pounds?

17:56.375 --> 17:57.176
Roughly.

17:59.775 --> 18:01.896
Seems inflation in the UK
is quite severe.

18:03.055 --> 18:04.896
When I worked there five years ago,

18:05.216 --> 18:06.656
the hourly wage was only 3 pounds.

18:11.575 --> 18:14.815
Mr. Gao, I don't remember
these minor details very clearly.

18:16.095 --> 18:18.575
But I think you could
assess my abilities more.

18:19.295 --> 18:22.575
Regarding my studies
and achievements on my resume,

18:22.575 --> 18:23.775
there's no falsification.

18:25.055 --> 18:26.375
If you could give me a chance,

18:26.976 --> 18:30.256
I'll prove to Letao
that I'm a trustworthy employee.

18:32.335 --> 18:34.095
But based on the information I have,

18:34.775 --> 18:39.095
the excellent academic performance
you claim doesn't seem very convincing.

18:42.976 --> 18:44.176
Mr. Gao, you've noticed it.

18:44.896 --> 18:46.496
My family situation is difficult.

18:47.256 --> 18:49.216
But I don't want to depend on others.

18:49.216 --> 18:53.055
So I had to work more shifts
and couldn't focus on studies.

18:53.055 --> 18:54.815
Work more shifts?

18:55.615 --> 18:56.496
From what I know,

18:56.496 --> 18:59.095
someone's been sending you money
from home for your education.

18:59.615 --> 19:00.416
Isn't that true?

19:01.775 --> 19:02.416
No.

19:03.295 --> 19:04.896
Mr. Gao, did someone tell you something?

19:04.896 --> 19:06.095
Could there be some...

19:18.976 --> 19:22.295
It seems nothing escapes you, Mr. Gao.

19:26.216 --> 19:27.496
I did have a girlfriend.

19:28.216 --> 19:31.295
She did fund my overseas studies.

19:33.016 --> 19:34.496
But while I was abroad,

19:35.368 --> 19:37.832
she couldn't handle the loneliness
and fell for someone else.

19:39.615 --> 19:40.775
When I found out,

19:40.775 --> 19:42.016
I was devastated.

19:43.456 --> 19:45.295
I was determined to come back
and marry her.

19:45.896 --> 19:47.456
I wanted to give her a good life.

19:47.456 --> 19:48.295
Never imagined...

19:50.016 --> 19:51.135
Right during that period,

19:52.295 --> 19:53.855
Die'en gave me tremendous comfort.

19:54.135 --> 19:55.775
We naturally grew close.

19:56.656 --> 19:59.055
After losing love,
I learned to cherish more deeply.

20:00.815 --> 20:02.736
Mr. Gao, please give me a chance.

20:03.696 --> 20:05.615
I'll work hard and earn money diligently

20:05.656 --> 20:06.815
to become worthy of Die'en.

20:12.176 --> 20:13.095
Money must be repaid.

20:14.055 --> 20:14.736
Yes.

20:14.736 --> 20:15.456
Moreover,

20:16.575 --> 20:17.696
Die'en is a good girl.

20:18.696 --> 20:19.976
I hope you'll cherish her.

20:21.696 --> 20:22.416
Take this.

20:31.736 --> 20:32.335
Mr. Gao.

20:33.696 --> 20:34.855
Please sign this document.

20:41.936 --> 20:44.095
(I really like the phone charm
you gave me. Thank you.)

21:01.976 --> 21:02.615
I'm leaving.

21:17.496 --> 21:19.176
Lin Huan'er!

21:21.095 --> 21:23.135
No wonder you broke up so decisively.

21:23.696 --> 21:25.295
Turns out you found someone better.

21:26.896 --> 21:28.375
I really underestimated you.

21:31.976 --> 21:32.736
Who is it?

21:33.095 --> 21:33.855
Hello, sir.

21:33.855 --> 21:35.016
Need cleaning service?

21:39.095 --> 21:39.656
Hello, sir.

21:39.656 --> 21:40.535
Need cleaning service?

21:40.535 --> 21:41.615
What cleaning service?

21:44.855 --> 21:45.656
What does this say?

21:45.775 --> 21:46.736
Do not disturb.

21:46.736 --> 21:47.615
Can you read this?

21:47.896 --> 21:48.680
Are you illiterate?

21:48.896 --> 21:51.176
- I'm sorry.
- Never seen such poor service abroad!

21:51.416 --> 21:52.416
Sorry for disturbing you.

21:52.416 --> 21:53.016
Get lost!

21:57.855 --> 21:59.775
Miss Lin, Haiming trusts you deeply.

22:00.016 --> 22:01.496
I hope we can collaborate soon.

22:02.216 --> 22:03.936
Mr. Gao is truly a good person.

22:04.575 --> 22:06.216
He takes good care of his subordinates.

22:06.976 --> 22:08.936
But his greatest strength

22:09.176 --> 22:10.535
is his consistency.

22:11.256 --> 22:14.295
Unlike some two-faced people
who say one thing

22:14.295 --> 22:15.295
but mean another.

22:15.295 --> 22:16.095
You never know

22:16.095 --> 22:18.696
whether what they show you
is genuine or an act.

22:19.375 --> 22:21.335
Appearances can be deceiving.

22:21.855 --> 22:24.815
That's terrifying, isn't it, Miss Cheng?

22:26.095 --> 22:26.736
Yes.

22:27.976 --> 22:28.615
Please go ahead.

22:28.615 --> 22:29.496
I forgot something.

22:38.456 --> 22:39.095
Didn't I say...

22:40.535 --> 22:41.095
Die'en?

22:41.896 --> 22:42.815
What brings you here?

22:44.055 --> 22:45.615
I thought you'd be busy until late.

22:46.896 --> 22:48.095
Why the sudden visit?

22:49.815 --> 22:51.335
Finished early, so I came to see you.

22:52.256 --> 22:54.055
How did the interview go?

22:56.656 --> 22:58.095
I feel Mr. Gao's philosophy and mine

22:58.095 --> 22:58.936
don't quite align.

22:59.896 --> 23:02.095
Though Letao is a major company,

23:02.095 --> 23:04.976
I don't want to work
where I can't utilize my strengths.

23:07.656 --> 23:09.176
I appreciate your introduction though.

23:09.575 --> 23:11.016
I feel bad for wasting your effort.

23:12.736 --> 23:13.535
It's fine.

23:13.535 --> 23:15.256
I'll find other
job opportunities for you.

23:18.095 --> 23:21.176
Today I discussed my design concepts
with Gao Haiming.

23:22.696 --> 23:24.936
Your high school classmate Miss Lin
was there too.

23:27.295 --> 23:27.896
Really?

23:31.016 --> 23:32.496
How was your talk with Mr. Gao?

23:32.496 --> 23:33.216
Can you partner?

23:34.736 --> 23:36.216
Should be possible.

23:36.575 --> 23:39.176
Miss Lin and I
share similar design philosophies.

23:39.416 --> 23:41.176
We got along quite well.

23:44.176 --> 23:47.696
Were you close in school?

23:49.896 --> 23:50.815
Fairly.

23:51.416 --> 23:52.896
You know, I used to be very innocent.

23:52.976 --> 23:54.055
I just focused on studying.

23:54.055 --> 23:55.696
I hated talking
to female classmates most.

24:02.295 --> 24:02.936
What?

24:04.295 --> 24:06.216
You're not jealous
of me and her, are you?

24:08.176 --> 24:09.575
She's just an ordinary classmate.

24:11.432 --> 24:13.128
I'm not jealous of you
and Gao Haiming yet.

24:17.896 --> 24:21.176
I'll figure something out
for your work situation.

24:22.456 --> 24:24.095
You keep working. I'm leaving.

24:25.295 --> 24:26.016
Leaving so soon?

24:28.496 --> 24:29.696
Really not stay for dinner?

24:30.095 --> 24:31.095
No.

24:31.095 --> 24:31.936
Let me walk you out.

24:32.095 --> 24:32.736
It's fine.

24:33.256 --> 24:34.855
You keep working. Bye.

24:37.696 --> 24:38.736
Be safe.

24:39.416 --> 24:40.055
Got it.

24:40.055 --> 24:41.095
Text me when you get home.

24:41.095 --> 24:41.736
Okay.

24:42.696 --> 24:43.295
Bye.

24:43.416 --> 24:44.135
Text me, okay?

24:59.216 --> 25:01.496
Qiuzi, call Ziqiang and the others.

25:01.815 --> 25:02.976
I have a big announcement.

25:07.775 --> 25:09.896
Because Xiaojue told me
he's never dated anyone.

25:11.135 --> 25:12.055
Really?

25:13.176 --> 25:15.295
He said he's never dated anyone?

25:19.615 --> 25:21.456
No, he really hasn't.

25:37.016 --> 25:37.535
Silly Goose.

25:37.535 --> 25:38.176
You're here.

25:38.792 --> 25:39.944
Baked sweet potato for you.

25:52.416 --> 25:53.256
You eat it.

25:53.496 --> 25:54.295
Let's share.

25:58.855 --> 26:00.176
Why do you want to see me?

26:05.976 --> 26:08.976
Xiaojue is back, you know?

26:09.656 --> 26:10.496
I know.

26:10.936 --> 26:12.976
Why bring him up?
You're ruining the mood.

26:15.535 --> 26:16.936
No, we're all classmates.

26:19.896 --> 26:21.615
Zhou Yuan, Ziqiang.

26:22.135 --> 26:25.016
Don't be fooled
by how put-together I look now.

26:26.095 --> 26:27.335
Dressed all fancy.

26:28.335 --> 26:30.696
Overseas, I was just like that waiter.

26:31.216 --> 26:32.936
Just serving tea and water, you know?

26:33.216 --> 26:34.656
I washed dishes every single day.

26:34.656 --> 26:35.775
Countless dishes.

26:35.775 --> 26:36.775
Look at my hands.

26:40.896 --> 26:43.216
Qiuzi, you're close with Huan'er.

26:44.095 --> 26:45.615
But I'll be honest with you all.

26:46.416 --> 26:49.295
She acts different around you
than she does with me.

26:49.295 --> 26:50.095
You know?

26:50.496 --> 26:51.615
I've been so wronged.

26:52.416 --> 26:55.295
You have no idea
what kind of person she really is.

26:57.016 --> 26:57.456
Come on.

26:58.135 --> 26:58.952
- Wipe your tears.
- I never expected

26:59.416 --> 27:02.016
that meek Lin Huan'er

27:02.135 --> 27:03.135
would turn out like this.

27:03.456 --> 27:05.216
Yeah, wake up already.

27:05.216 --> 27:06.375
We're not in school anymore.

27:06.375 --> 27:07.295
Stop playing innocent.

27:07.416 --> 27:09.456
I shouldn't even
be telling you some of this.

27:10.176 --> 27:11.775
But I'm just so frustrated inside.

27:12.456 --> 27:13.375
Come on.

27:13.456 --> 27:14.135
Drink up.

27:14.135 --> 27:14.775
Bottoms up.

27:23.135 --> 27:24.656
It's fine. This'll blow over.

27:25.176 --> 27:26.535
(Huan'er dumped Xiaojue. Is that true?)
After all, you can't judge someone

27:27.135 --> 27:28.335
at first glance.

27:30.775 --> 27:34.295
Mengmeng, Xiaojue told me something.

27:37.855 --> 27:39.095
It's nothing serious, really.

27:39.095 --> 27:41.135
(Huan'er dumped Xiaojue. Is that true?)
It's just Xiao...

27:41.815 --> 27:42.615
What's wrong?

27:43.535 --> 27:44.936
Silly Goose, let's go.

27:45.855 --> 27:46.775
Let's go, Silly Goose.

27:47.375 --> 27:48.976
Wait, Mengmeng...

27:52.575 --> 27:55.216
Xiaojue, what are you going to do now?

27:57.176 --> 27:58.176
What can I possibly do?

27:59.016 --> 28:00.016
She's climbed up high.

28:00.496 --> 28:01.416
I wish her happiness.

28:04.496 --> 28:06.456
Honestly, a hypocritical snake like her,

28:06.976 --> 28:08.095
who forgets old bonds,

28:08.095 --> 28:09.295
doesn't deserve kindness.

28:09.456 --> 28:11.016
But I remember old bonds, right?

28:11.535 --> 28:13.575
We've got your back.
No one messes with us!

28:13.976 --> 28:14.575
Move!

28:17.855 --> 28:18.896
Say that again?

28:20.016 --> 28:21.256
Mengmeng, how are you here?

28:21.256 --> 28:23.896
She worked herself to the bone
to send you abroad.

28:23.896 --> 28:24.696
Now you're back,

28:24.696 --> 28:26.095
and this is how you describe her?

28:26.456 --> 28:27.896
Do you have any conscience?

28:27.896 --> 28:29.896
No conscience at all? I'll kill you!

28:30.016 --> 28:31.375
No, Mengmeng. Let me explain.

28:31.375 --> 28:32.696
- No conscience at all?
- Let me explain.

28:32.696 --> 28:33.535
Explain what?

28:33.535 --> 28:34.535
- Mengmeng!
- Explain what?

28:34.535 --> 28:34.976
Mengmeng.

28:35.976 --> 28:37.696
- Mengmeng!
- Stop... Mengmeng!

28:37.736 --> 28:38.575
You asked for this!

28:38.575 --> 28:39.815
- Tiehan!
- You asked for this!

28:40.176 --> 28:41.176
Ask him if you doubt!

28:41.375 --> 28:42.575
Tiehan knows everything.

28:46.656 --> 28:47.575
You know it too?

28:56.328 --> 28:58.952
(He says the opposite meaning straight.)

28:59.176 --> 28:59.736
Mengmeng.

29:01.135 --> 29:01.815
Mengmeng.

29:02.135 --> 29:02.815
Don't be angry.

29:03.135 --> 29:04.256
Don't follow me!

29:05.016 --> 29:06.855
Wait, listen to me.

29:07.896 --> 29:09.176
Mengmeng, yes...

29:10.696 --> 29:11.416
Don't be angry.

29:11.896 --> 29:12.696
I know everything.

29:13.775 --> 29:14.815
Xiaojue came to see me.

29:15.176 --> 29:17.256
He said Huan'er wanted to break up
after he returned.

29:18.456 --> 29:20.575
He's actually heartbroken too.

29:20.896 --> 29:22.896
He kept asking how to win Huan'er back.

29:23.095 --> 29:24.416
He blamed the victim first!

29:24.976 --> 29:26.375
Do you believe everything he says?

29:26.496 --> 29:28.656
Don't you know what kind
of person Huan'er is?

29:29.016 --> 29:31.095
She worked so hard
with multiple jobs every day,

29:31.095 --> 29:32.416
running off her feet

29:32.855 --> 29:34.216
just to send him money.

29:34.535 --> 29:36.055
Now she finally got into Letao

29:36.055 --> 29:37.375
and finally settled down.

29:37.456 --> 29:38.855
Yet he comes back and slanders her?

30:02.216 --> 30:06.496
But Huan'er's been alone here
all this time.

30:07.456 --> 30:09.095
Who's to say there weren't issues?

30:10.575 --> 30:11.896
How dare you say that about her!

30:14.016 --> 30:14.815
Great now.

30:15.575 --> 30:18.416
Huan'er's seen as a gold-digger
who only cares about money!

30:18.855 --> 30:21.176
If Ou Xiaojue truly wanted her back,

30:21.656 --> 30:23.496
would he badmouth her
in front of everyone?

30:23.976 --> 30:26.095
Doesn't he know
what this would do to her?

30:28.095 --> 30:28.736
Mengmeng.

30:31.464 --> 30:33.295
- The four of us...
- Stop following me!

30:47.696 --> 30:48.295
Mengmeng.

30:50.095 --> 30:50.696
Mengmeng.

30:51.456 --> 30:53.736
Why are you sitting here alone?

30:53.976 --> 30:54.855
Aren't you cold?

30:56.656 --> 30:57.496
What's wrong?

31:03.615 --> 31:05.216
Let me guess then.

31:05.896 --> 31:08.496
Did your fairytale romance shatter?

31:10.216 --> 31:11.375
You already know?

31:12.575 --> 31:14.656
I was figuring out how to tell you.

31:15.696 --> 31:16.615
It's no big deal.

31:17.095 --> 31:18.896
It's just that he cheated in the UK.

31:18.896 --> 31:20.135
I'll just dump him.

31:20.135 --> 31:21.855
He cheated?

31:21.855 --> 31:23.256
He actually cheated?

31:23.256 --> 31:24.216
You didn't know?

31:24.216 --> 31:27.976
I should've smashed
that beer bottle over his head.

31:27.976 --> 31:29.216
No need for that.

31:29.216 --> 31:30.855
I'm going right now.

31:30.855 --> 31:32.416
Mengmeng, calm down.

31:32.416 --> 31:33.095
Let me go!

31:33.456 --> 31:35.615
Mengmeng!

31:35.615 --> 31:36.496
Listen to me.

31:36.496 --> 31:37.496
Go home first.

31:38.055 --> 31:39.615
I know you're furious.

31:39.696 --> 31:40.575
Calm down first.

31:40.656 --> 31:41.696
Alright.

31:41.896 --> 31:43.896
That Ou Xiaojue, I...

31:44.176 --> 31:45.256
Alright.

31:45.815 --> 31:48.375
Look. I'm not even sad over him.

31:48.896 --> 31:50.416
So you shouldn't be angry either.

31:50.896 --> 31:52.496
Getting so angry over a shameless fool.

31:52.496 --> 31:53.456
Is it worth it?

31:55.095 --> 31:57.016
I just feel so bad for you.

31:57.375 --> 31:59.416
You did so much for him all these years.

31:59.855 --> 32:01.976
So I need to cut my losses now.

32:02.176 --> 32:04.016
I can't waste another second on him,

32:06.855 --> 32:07.496
right?

32:10.295 --> 32:12.135
But we can't let him off so easy.

32:12.135 --> 32:13.176
Just let him walk away?

32:13.176 --> 32:14.496
How can we let him off?

32:14.656 --> 32:15.815
He's already smeared me.

32:15.815 --> 32:17.095
We have to hit back!

32:17.375 --> 32:18.375
Yes, hit back!

32:23.055 --> 32:24.456
Can we go home now?

32:27.575 --> 32:29.016
Let's go home together.

32:33.216 --> 32:35.335
Alright. No more anger, okay?

32:45.295 --> 32:46.496
Fuchuang pulled our products

32:46.496 --> 32:47.496
as expected.

32:49.016 --> 32:50.375
How's the new product coming?

32:50.575 --> 32:53.416
Dr. Wei's core tech upgrades
are successful.

32:53.416 --> 32:55.624
Finished products are ready.
You can inspect anytime.

32:56.295 --> 32:59.055
But we're hitting snags
with distributors.

33:01.095 --> 33:02.696
The northern market's too conservative.

33:03.615 --> 33:05.775
Breaking into the East
is more strategic now.

33:06.896 --> 33:10.855
Xinye is based in Lvcheng,

33:11.055 --> 33:13.496
but their distribution network
in the East is solid.

33:13.615 --> 33:14.575
Worth prioritizing.

33:14.696 --> 33:15.575
Also these two.

33:15.855 --> 33:17.095
- Huineng...
- Lvcheng will do.

33:17.496 --> 33:18.496
Schedule visits.

33:18.496 --> 33:18.976
Okay.

33:24.416 --> 33:25.095
Miss Cheng.

33:27.295 --> 33:29.016
Surprised you invited me here.

33:29.016 --> 33:30.295
Any new proposal?

33:30.575 --> 33:31.295
Miss Cheng.

33:32.256 --> 33:33.176
Where's Miss Lin?

33:34.535 --> 33:35.575
Let's talk. It's personal.

33:38.095 --> 33:39.256
You wanted to talk to me?

33:39.976 --> 33:41.575
The matter is somewhat serious.

33:46.856 --> 33:48.040
(Letao Tower)

33:55.095 --> 33:55.896
Miss Cheng.

33:57.615 --> 33:58.815
Miss Lin, you're here.

33:59.375 --> 34:00.696
I was just looking for you.

34:00.696 --> 34:01.416
Here's the thing.

34:01.416 --> 34:02.216
I have a friend.

34:02.216 --> 34:03.216
She's a comic artist.

34:03.496 --> 34:06.216
She saw the packaging design
you recently did for the Her Series.

34:06.615 --> 34:08.456
She really liked it
and admired it a lot.

34:08.936 --> 34:10.615
This is a comic she recently drew.

34:11.776 --> 34:15.615
It tells the story of a fool
borrowing money from his girlfriend.

34:17.816 --> 34:19.215
She hopes you could take a look,

34:19.215 --> 34:20.095
giving some guidance.

34:24.016 --> 34:25.255
Guidance is too strong a word.

34:25.255 --> 34:26.416
Call it an exchange of ideas.

34:27.416 --> 34:28.200
I'll read it later.

34:28.416 --> 34:29.416
Thank you, Miss Lin.

34:30.816 --> 34:31.456
Take care.

34:44.512 --> 34:47.495
♪Entwined worries linger♪

34:48.704 --> 34:51.475
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

34:53.376 --> 34:59.289
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

35:01.086 --> 35:04.146
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

35:05.312 --> 35:08.764
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

35:09.760 --> 35:15.286
♪Until the world's end♪

35:17.696 --> 35:21.492
♪If I could♪

35:22.080 --> 35:24.896
♪Keep loving you♪

35:25.920 --> 35:28.320
♪Hearing two hearts♪

35:28.320 --> 35:33.236
♪Beating together♪

35:34.208 --> 35:38.072
♪If I could♪

35:38.072 --> 35:41.312
♪Stay resting in your arms♪

35:42.368 --> 35:49.693
♪I'd trade the rest of my life for it♪

35:50.752 --> 35:53.696
♪Entwined worries linger♪

35:54.944 --> 35:57.696
♪My heart is not empty,
yet pain remains♪

35:59.552 --> 36:05.332
♪Now I see what passed between us♪

36:07.264 --> 36:10.289
♪Walking through the crowd to meet you♪

36:11.534 --> 36:15.200
♪Going through surging tides of people♪

36:15.968 --> 36:21.815
♪Until the world's end♪

36:23.808 --> 36:27.712
♪If I could♪

